        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. Leave for Professional Improvement (Extended Periods Such as a Semester or School Year)—Upon recommendation of the superintendent, leave of absence, without pay, for study or other Professional improvement may be granted to eligible unit members by the Board of Education for a period not to exceed one (1) year. The unit member must submit an outline of a planned program with his/her application for such leave.",
